### ============================================================
### EVRIM API - REST Client Test Dosyasi
### VS Code "REST Client" extension ile calistirilir
### ============================================================
### Swagger: https://vrbmvc.evrim.com/EvrimEntMVC.dll/swagger/index.html
### ============================================================

@evrimBaseUrl = https://vrbmvc.evrim.com:443/EvrimEntMVC.dll/api
@evrimUsername = EVRIM_8059
@evrimPassword = Evrim8059

### ============================================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION - JWT Token Al
### ============================================================

### 1a. Login - JWT Token olustur
POST {{evrimBaseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json
username: {{evrimUsername}}
password: {{evrimPassword}}

### Token'i buraya yapistiriniz (1a response'undan)
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJFdnJpbSBGcmFtZXdvcmsgU3dhZ2dlciBEb2N1bWVudGF0aW9uIiwiZXhwIjoxNzcxNDQ3NzU3LCJuYmYiOjE3NzE0NDM4NTcsImlhdCI6MTc3MTQ0NDE1Nywicm9sZXMiOiIiLCJ1c2VybmFtZSI6IkVWUklNXzgwNTkifQ.JqYdMn_gJVTzjqBXOa4G_lGdps5mhYOa__2QytJo811tphraaGS447ox9e_QNjXpTgzAh2hcpLlqzJ0Fo_aTjQ

### ============================================================
### 2. ITHALAT (IMPORT) DOSYA ISLEMLERI
### ============================================================

